OL,3,GNEWSABe on your best behaviour! Festive
OL,4,Aelves pop up around London's landmarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to some of London's most
OL,7,Frecognisable landmarks should be on
OL,8,Ftheir best behaviour this festive
OL,9,Fseason after numerous giant elves
OL,10,Fappeared.
OL,12,FThey are part of a Christmas Elf on the
OL,13,FShelf trail which features 12
OL,14,Fartist-designed sculptures that can be
OL,15,Ffound in locations including Trafalgar
OL,16,FSquare, Victoria Tower Gardens,
OL,17,FWestminster Abbey, St James' Park and
OL,18,Fthe Strand.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
