OL,3,GNEWSABe on your best behaviour! Festive
OL,4,Aelves pop up around London's landmarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe colourful hand-painted elves each
OL,7,Fstand at 1.9m (6ft 2in) and have their
OL,8,Fown design, including Christmas
OL,9,Fjumpers, twinkling stars and
OL,10,Fsnowflakes.
OL,12,FThe free public trail celebrates
OL,13,Fkindness and invites children to
OL,14,Freflect on their good deeds as they
OL,15,Fawait their visit from Father
OL,16,FChristmas.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
